  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Bringing out the camera with the new quick menu requires multiple clicks and is too slow to catch the action. There should be a dedicated button on the launch menu to pop out the photo camera or make it so opening the camera menu spawns the photo camera by default. Otherwise at least bring the photo camera button closer to the camera menu button so you don't have to point all the way up the quick menu to bring it out.",
